Package: knitrmini
Type: Package
Title: Minimal Knitr Engine for Rnw to TeX to PDF conversion
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Urtzi", "Enriquez-Urzelai", email = "uenriquez@proton.me",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yihui", "Xie", role = "cph",
           comment = "author of knitr, on which knitrmini is based"))
Description: A minimal rewrite of knitr supporting rnoweb (.Rnw) to LaTeX
    to PDF conversion, with full knitr-compatible chunk options and caching.
    Produces clean LaTeX output without knitrout/kframe wrapping.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    evaluate (>= 0.15),
    highr (>= 0.11),
    xfun (>= 0.52),
    digest,
    tools,
    utils,
    methods
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tinytex (>= 0.56),
    roxygen2,
    renv,
    withr
License: GPL
URL: https://github.com/urtzienriquez/knitrmini
BugReports: https://github.com/urtzienriquez/knitrmini/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
